{
  "why": "Keep the bytes of every reference sheet and set plate while Flow's signed URL is alive, so a series page can show the faces the pipeline reuses (db/012 sheet_media, /api/media/ingest field=sheets). Six nodes, two per chain: Prep (Code, one item out always) -> ? (IF, !skip) -> Ingest (HTTP, onError continueRegularOutput, one request for the whole pass).",
  "nodes": [
